---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import {withBase} from '../../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="013 — The Switchboard / Lumpesammlig" description="A performative study of portable community as connections between independently authored records.">
<main>
<nav><a href={withBase('/#library')}>← COLLECTION</a><span>013 / THE SWITCHBOARD</span></nav>
<header><p class="kicker">Found mechanism → performative translation</p><h1>The Switchboard.</h1><p class="lede">A conversation need not live where its participants do. What if a community interface connected independent voices without owning them?</p></header>
<section><p class="kicker">01 / Encounter</p><h2>Independent endpoints.</h2><p class="notes">An old telephone switchboard joins separate lines. Its useful property isn't the cables or the vintage hardware: it is temporary routing between endpoints. But who gets to operate it? The metaphor contains its own political problem.</p></section>
<section><p class="kicker">02 / Executable reading</p><h2>Change the connection. Not the source.</h2><p class="small">All contributions below are synthetic and fixed. Switching a topic changes the projection only; no record is edited.</p><div class="controls" role="group" aria-label="Conversation lens"><button data-lens="all" aria-pressed="true">All lines</button><button data-lens="indexing" aria-pressed="false">Indexing</button><button data-lens="community" aria-pressed="false">Community</button></div><div class="plate"><svg id="switchboard" viewBox="0 0 700 220" role="img" aria-label="Diagram of independent contributors linked to a shared problem"><g id="lines"></g><g id="nodes"></g></svg><p id="status" class="small" aria-live="polite"></p></div><div id="voices" class="voices"></div></section>
<section><p class="kicker">03 / The risk</p><p class="notes">A switchboard can make relations visible, but it can also imply a central operator who controls the conversation. Here the operator controls only this view. Each contribution keeps its author and text. A connection is an interpretation, not consensus.</p><p class="small">Fixture only; no ATProto integration. <a href="https://github.com/blackmath88/br-ai-nstorm">br-ai-nstorm provenance model</a> · <a href="https://github.com/blackmath88/postack-underflow">Postack Underflow</a></p></section>
</main>
<script>
const data=[
{id:'A',author:'Author A',topic:'indexing',kind:'claim',text:'Index problems solved, not just repository names.'},
{id:'B',author:'Author B',topic:'indexing',kind:'question',text:'How do we distinguish a working fix from a popular one?'},
{id:'C',author:'Author C',topic:'community',kind:'claim',text:'A discussion should not require everyone to join one website.'},
{id:'D',author:'Author D',topic:'community',kind:'disagreement',text:'A common index still needs moderation and governance.'}
];
const ns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg',lines=document.querySelector<SVGGElement>('#lines')!,nodes=document.querySelector<SVGGElement>('#nodes')!,voices=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#voices')!,status=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#status')!;
function svg(tag:string,attrs:Record<string,string>,parent:Element){const e=document.createElementNS(ns,tag);for(const [k,v] of Object.entries(attrs))e.setAttribute(k,v);parent.append(e);return e}
function render(lens:string){lines.replaceChildren();nodes.replaceChildren();voices.replaceChildren();const visible=data.filter(x=>lens==='all'||x.topic===lens);const center=svg('circle',{cx:'350',cy:'110',r:'35',fill:'#252a30'},nodes);const label=svg('text',{x:'350',y:'114','text-anchor':'middle',fill:'#f5f3ec','font-size':'12'},nodes);label.textContent='PROBLEM';visible.forEach((d,i)=>{const x=90+i*(520/Math.max(visible.length-1,1)),y=i%2?185:35;svg('path',{d:`M${x} ${y} Q350 ${y} 350 110`,fill:'none',stroke:d.kind==='disagreement'?'#ee4f7e':d.topic==='community'?'#a36bff':'#4a6288','stroke-width':'3'},lines);svg('circle',{cx:String(x),cy:String(y),r:'18',fill:d.topic==='community'?'#a36bff':'#4a6288'},nodes);const t=svg('text',{x:String(x),y:String(y+4),'text-anchor':'middle','font-size':'12',fill:'white'},nodes);t.textContent=d.id;const el=document.createElement('article');const h=document.createElement('h3');h.textContent=d.author+' · '+d.kind;const p=document.createElement('p');p.textContent=d.text;const meta=document.createElement('p');meta.className='tag';meta.textContent='FIXTURE / '+d.id+' / '+d.topic;el.append(meta,h,p);voices.append(el)});status.textContent=visible.length+' of '+data.length+' independent contributions shown. Original fixture records unchanged.'}
document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-lens]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{document.querySelectorAll('[data-lens]').forEach(x=>x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(x===b)));render(b.dataset.lens||'all')}));render('all');
</script>
<style>.controls{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:20px 0}.plate{margin-bottom:22px}svg{width:100%;height:auto}.voices{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:18px}.voices article{border-top:2px solid #4a6288;padding:16px 0}.voices h3{font-size:19px}.voices p{line-height:1.5}</style>
<style>
:global(body){background:#f5f3ec;color:#252a30;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif}
main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:24px clamp(18px,5vw,70px) 100px}
nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid #aeb4bc;padding:12px 0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em}
a{color:inherit}header{padding:clamp(40px,9vw,110px) 0 50px}h1{font-size:clamp(46px,8vw,108px);line-height:.97;letter-spacing:-.065em;max-width:900px;margin:20px 0}h2{font-size:clamp(25px,4vw,48px);letter-spacing:-.045em}.kicker{color:#4a6288;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}.lede{max-width:670px;font-size:clamp(17px,2vw,23px);line-height:1.5}section{border-top:1px solid #aeb4bc;padding:36px 0}button,input{font:inherit}button{cursor:pointer;border:1px solid #4a6288;background:transparent;color:#252a30;padding:12px 16px}button[aria-pressed="true"],button:focus-visible{background:#4a6288;color:white}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #a36bff;outline-offset:3px}.small{font-size:12px;color:#58616d}.plate{border:1px solid #aeb4bc;padding:20px;background:#fffefa}.notes{max-width:720px;line-height:1.65}.tag{font:12px ui-monospace,monospace;color:#4a6288}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*:before,*:after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}
</style>
</BaseLayout>